---
// Core Identity section
---

<section class="sec" id="identity">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="split">
      <div class="stack">
        <p class="eyebrow">Core identity</p>
        <h2 class="h2">An elite student community with a real company behind it.</h2>
        <div class="body">
          <p>GWD Club is a student-driven chapter based in Hyderabad. It operates under its parent firm, GWD Global Pvt Ltd, which puts members beside live business work: automation projects, sports broadcasts and startup conversations.</p>
          <p>The club exists to change a familiar pattern. Students collect marks and certificates, then learn the job after graduation. Here they start on the job while they study.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-stage">
        <div class="stage" data-stage="identity" role="img" aria-label="A large wireframe shell labelled GWD Global around a solid core labelled GWD Club, with members orbiting the core">
          <p class="cap">Shell: GWD Global · Core: Club · Orbit: members</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="pillars">
      <article class="pillar">
        <p class="mono" style="color:var(--accent)">Mission</p>
        <h3>Build an elite student community</h3>
        <p>A selective, builder-first group where peers raise each other's standard and everyone owns a result.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="pillar">
        <p class="mono" style="color:var(--accent)">Mission</p>
        <h3>Bridge academia and industry</h3>
        <p>Members work on deployments run by the parent firm and its divisions, so the classroom meets a live client.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="pillar">
        <p class="mono" style="color:var(--accent)">Mission</p>
        <h3>Move beyond theoretical scores</h3>
        <p>Proof of work counts: workflows in production, streams that went live, ideas that reached a pitch.</p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="vs panel" role="table" aria-label="Scores compared with proof of work">
      <div class="vs-row vs-head" role="row">
        <div role="columnheader">On a transcript</div>
        <div role="columnheader">In the club</div>
      </div>
      <div class="vs-row" role="row">
        <div role="cell">Marks and certificates</div>
        <div role="cell">Automations running in production</div>
      </div>
      <div class="vs-row" role="row">
        <div role="cell">Group assignments</div>
        <div role="cell">Cross-vertical teams with owners and deadlines</div>
      </div>
      <div class="vs-row" role="row">
        <div role="cell">Mock events</div>
        <div role="cell">Live tournaments, streamed and filmed</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="tree">
      <div class="tree-wrap">
        <div class="stack">
          <p class="eyebrow">Governance</p>
          <h2 class="h2">Who runs what.</h2>
          <p class="lead">Authority runs from the parent firm to the chapter, then to the President, the Vice President and the six vertical leads.</p>
        </div>
        <ol>
          <li>
            <p class="t-label">Parent firm</p>
            <p class="t-name">GWD Global Pvt Ltd</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <p class="t-label">Chapter</p>
            <p class="t-name">GWD Club, Hyderabad</p>
            <p class="t-sub">Flagship hub at VJIT Hyderabad</p>
          </li>
          <li class="hot">
            <p class="t-label">President</p>
            <p class="t-name">Mohammed Abdul Mudabbir</p>
          </li>
          <li class="hot">
            <p class="t-label">Vice President</p>
            <p class="t-name">Mohd Abdul Rahman Pasha</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <p class="t-label">Vertical leads</p>
            <div class="chips">
              <span class="chip">Technical</span>
              <span class="chip">Freelancing Coordinator</span>
              <span class="chip">Startup &amp; Investment</span>
              <span class="chip">Marketing &amp; Outreach</span>
              <span class="chip">Production</span>
              <span class="chip">Event Coordination</span>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <p class="t-label">Members</p>
            <p class="t-name">Students working inside the verticals</p>
            <p class="t-sub">Every member ships on live projects.</p>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
